# Example high-risk path list for factory/bin/sf-risk-audit.sh.
# One shell glob per line; "#" starts a comment. "*" also matches "/".
# A leading "**/" also matches at the root. Keep a real list per repository in the home's
# private data, each glob with a one-line reason.
**/auth/**            # login, sessions, tokens
**/permission*        # roles and access checks
**/billing/**         # payments and invoices
**/migrations/**      # database migrations, not undone by a revert
**/*.proto            # wire and storage schemas
deploy/**             # deploy and runtime config
**/Dockerfile*        # runtime images
.github/workflows/**  # CI workflows
**/notify*/**         # customer notifications
**/.env*              # secrets handling
